<title>UK: Swiss Bank Corp sets warrants on DTB-Bobl-Future.</title>
<headline>Swiss Bank Corp sets warrants on DTB-Bobl-Future.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp says it has issued 60 million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the DTB-Bobl-Future December 1996.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 02.SEP.96-06.DEC.96   PAYDATE	30.AUG.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  101.70 PCT</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	 ISS PRICE     PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	  101.50 PCT   0.92 DEM	0.70 PCT     110.50 X</p>
<p> CALL B	  102.00 PCT   0.67 DEM	1.00 PCT     151.80 X</p>
<p> CALL C	  102.50 PCT   0.46 DEM	1.20 PCT     221.10 X</p>
<p> PUT D	   101.00 PCT   0.52 DEM	1.20 PCT     195.60 X</p>
<p> PUT E	   101.50 PCT   0.72 DEM	0.90 PCT     141.30 X</p>
<p> PUT F	   102.00 PCT   0.97 DEM	0.70 PCT     104.80 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
